# Copy lines you need into `frontend/.env.local` (gitignored).
#
# Local dev + http://localhost (including `vite preview`) already default the UI to Pro — no env required.
#
# PMS Report / MAUDE evidence (Post-market report, pipeline, NLP): no VITE_* API keys.
# Configure the FastAPI backend instead:
#   OPENAI_API_KEY  — required for MAUDE narrative extraction
#   OPENFDA_API_KEY — optional; better openFDA rate limits for ingest
# See: fmea_backend/postmarket.env.example and fmea_backend/ENV.local.example
#
# Optional overrides:
# VITE_FORCE_PLAN=pro   — force Pro UI on non-localhost (e.g. staging)
# VITE_FORCE_PLAN=lite  — force Lite UI even on localhost (for testing)
